-- The nameplate drawings of Flat UI setup (FlatUI/SetupDrawPlates.lua). Every label starts "sdplate:". The values are kept in one table: the main function of
-- this file has a limit on the locals alive at once. A drawn setting is checked by building the drawing on a stage, taking a fingerprint of every frame and
-- region under it, writing another value and drawing again: the fingerprint must differ.
do
	local SD = {}
	-- Path, drawing, a value that differs from the default, and what the row needs first.
	SD.ROWS = {
