-- Setup drawings of steps 23 to 27 (FlatUI/SetupDrawCasts.lua): mock-cast-bar, mock-resource and mock-swing. Every label starts "sdcast:". The values are kept in
-- one table L, since the main function of this file has a limit on the locals alive at once. Each drawing is built on a stage frame of its own; its regions are
-- read back from the simulated client (shown, alpha, size, points, colour, texture, text, font, justification) and compared as one line.
